        {
            "title": "New Update",
            "date": "2018-06-08 11:16:40",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2431262152938709607",
            "notes": "Now you can choose between the original and the new timer bomb experience, In the new experience, you have a limited time to catch the birds before the bomb explodes and make you fall all the way to the ground.\r\nThis makes the game more exciting and fun."
        },
        {
            "title": "New Update",
            "date": "2018-05-21 10:22:17",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2391853754550202055",
            "notes": "Now you can press the s key on your keyboard to skip to the next level, for example, if a player gets stuck on a level.\r\n\r\nAlso, the birds are now closer to catch in the new levels."
        },
        {
            "title": "Big Update",
            "date": "2018-05-15 09:01:09",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/3822871998327918630",
            "notes": "10 new levels to experience.\r\nThe experience is now divided into 3 sections, Basic, Medium, and Extreme.\r\nNow you can restart from the beginning by pressing the r key on your keyboard."
        },
